- MDPI *Applied Sciences* 13(9):5739 DNS centrality figures (403).
- ACM DL PDFs: SPF "Lazy Gatekeepers" (IMC'23), IPFS SIGCOMM'22 (403).
- Any DNS resolver-share measurement after Sept 2019 (potaroo.net 403s the whole domain; APNIC blog search unusable).
- Root server system funding sources and query volumes (root-servers.org FAQ silent; icann.org 403).
- netsplit.de per-year IRC top-10 tables 1998–2026 (client-side rendered).
- BitTorrent DHT population after 2014; BitTorrent tracker-mortality longitudinal studies.
- TOP1000 `full.txt` for 2000/12 and 2006/06 (fetch timeouts).
- OpenAlex became unavailable mid-session (daily API budget exhausted); later academic search ran on Crossref, arXiv, Semantic Scholar and HN Algolia only. arXiv over plain `http://export.arxiv.org` 301s and returns empty — must use `https://`.
